<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>تطبيق Flask التجريبي</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f9; text-align: center; padding-top: 50px; }
        .container { background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        input, button { padding: 10px; margin: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
        button { background-color: #007BFF; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; }
        button:hover { background-color: #0056b3; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>أهلاً بك في تطبيق Flask</h2>
        <form action="/submit" method="POST">
            <label for="username">أدخل اسمك:</label><br>
            <input type="text" id="username" name="username" required><br>
            <button type="submit">إرسال</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
